{"3618560":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"DEATHMARK","steam_appid":3618560,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Roadmap<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roadmap Notes<\/strong><br>- (June 4th 2026) All the May bullet points have been delivered! We're now shifting our focus towards everything for June &amp; July. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/80eadf8076bde7e5c27a2f710de275ac.avif?t=1785132623\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras_big\/80eadf8076bde7e5c27a2f710de275ac.avif?t=1785132623 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>게임 정보<\/h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/83a6096013d0274022509160bd6d8bf2.avif?t=1785132623\" width=1280 height=323 \/><\/span><strong>DEATHMARK<\/strong> is an occult, table‑top social deduction game where up to <strong>8 players<\/strong> sit around a table, submit their <strong>cards<\/strong> or other actions secretly, and watch the chaos ensue. Bluff, redirect, protect, put on trial and betray your so-called friends. Can you survive the <strong>DEATHMARK<\/strong>?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/9985c2b1adee4409dc05f1cf0825fc67.webp?t=1785132623\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/9985c2b1adee4409dc05f1cf0825fc67.poster.avif?t=1785132623\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=250 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A group of silly cultists are attempting to complete a card-based ritual in the In-Between. As the name suggests, it's a realm between the physical plane and the astral plane. The twist? Some cultists among the group are corrupted by an entity and will try to backstab the others to be the only ones to ascend...<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Untainted<\/strong>: Uncover the Corrupted and eliminate them before you are eliminated using cards or by trialing out suspicious cultists.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corrupted<\/strong>: Eliminate the Untainted and avoid being discovered at all costs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/704fba8985a7f8afae28b7c073c83d7a.poster.avif?t=1785132623\" width=1000 height=420 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/704fba8985a7f8afae28b7c073c83d7a.mp4?t=1785132623\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If we were to describe the way this game works in one word, it'd be &quot;chaotic&quot;. But we mean it in a good way!<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Selection Phase<\/strong>: Everyone selects cards or actions and, if required, targets. Then submits them to the entity using their stamp.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Phase<\/strong>: The entity processes all cards simultaneously, will you gain information this turn? Perhaps your friend will steal one of your cards. Or maybe you'll receive the <strong>DEATHMARK<\/strong>? Chaos awaits...<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion Phase<\/strong>: Discuss with the entire table about the events of the current turn. Did your suspicions fall on someone else? Will you perhaps start a trial against a player you suspect is against you? Be careful, you only get one of those per game...<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat<\/strong>: The game keeps going until a team is declared the winner (or the host of your lobby loses power all of a sudden). The winning team gets to ascend to the astral plane, hooray!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/90c5ebd8cc84cdda1a55d70390e22da1.webp?t=1785132623\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/90c5ebd8cc84cdda1a55d70390e22da1.poster.avif?t=1785132623\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=250 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every role brings <strong>at least two unique Ability cards<\/strong> and a chargeable <strong>Sigil<\/strong>—a physical totem on the table that <strong>charges<\/strong> as you play and can be activated as a powerful game-changing action when ready. Items are available to all roles and introduce a variety of ways to gather intel and play the game, turning a single turn into a mind‑game.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/b118f6a8565830c417b737d04a8acc8e.webp?t=1785132623\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/b118f6a8565830c417b737d04a8acc8e.poster.avif?t=1785132623\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=250 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create a <strong>private lobby code<\/strong>, fill a table, and get ready for a fun game night. Can you figure out who to trust?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 to 8‑player online social deduction<\/strong> with simultaneous card submissions.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two factions, hidden roles<\/strong> — The Corrupted team knows who they are to each other, but not who is what specific role.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple roles<\/strong> with 2 Ability cards + a charge‑based Sigil to flip a round.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Private lobby codes<\/strong> for quick party nights.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/83a6096013d0274022509160bd6d8bf2.avif?t=1785132623\" width=1280 height=323 \/><\/span><strong>DEATHMARK<\/strong> is an occult, table‑top social deduction game where up to <strong>8 players<\/strong> sit around a table, submit their <strong>cards<\/strong> or other actions secretly, and watch the chaos ensue. Bluff, redirect, protect, put on trial and betray your so-called friends. Can you survive the <strong>DEATHMARK<\/strong>?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/9985c2b1adee4409dc05f1cf0825fc67.webp?t=1785132623\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/9985c2b1adee4409dc05f1cf0825fc67.poster.avif?t=1785132623\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=250 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A group of silly cultists are attempting to complete a card-based ritual in the In-Between. As the name suggests, it's a realm between the physical plane and the astral plane. The twist? Some cultists among the group are corrupted by an entity and will try to backstab the others to be the only ones to ascend...<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Untainted<\/strong>: Uncover the Corrupted and eliminate them before you are eliminated using cards or by trialing out suspicious cultists.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corrupted<\/strong>: Eliminate the Untainted and avoid being discovered at all costs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/704fba8985a7f8afae28b7c073c83d7a.poster.avif?t=1785132623\" width=1000 height=420 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/extras\/704fba8985a7f8afae28b7c073c83d7a.mp4?t=1785132623\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If we were to describe the way this game works in one word, it'd be &quot;chaotic&quot;. But we mean it in a good way!<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Selection Phase<\/strong>: Everyone selects cards or actions and, if required, targets. Then submits them to the entity using their stamp.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Phase<\/strong>: The entity processes all cards simultaneously, will you gain information this turn? Perhaps your friend will steal one of your cards. Or maybe you'll receive the <strong>DEATHMARK<\/strong>? Chaos awaits...<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion Phase<\/strong>: Discuss with the entire table about the events of the current turn. Did your suspicions fall on someone else? Will you perhaps start a trial against a player you suspect is against you? Be careful, you only get one of those per game...<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat<\/strong>: The game keeps going until a team is declared the winner (or the host of your lobby loses power all of a sudden). The winning team gets to ascend to the astral plane, hooray!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct