bby codes<\/strong> for quick party nights.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"An occult social‑deduction card game for 4 to 8 players. Play your cards in secret, find and eliminate the opposing team and avoid the DEATHMARK!","supported_languages":"영어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/cce219dfefb63153bac9a56df48ffbb180ad6e79\/header.jpg?t=1785132623","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/7c0de181bff9c4420754adcd20273d49b94461b0\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785132623","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/7c0de181bff9c4420754adcd20273d49b94461b0\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785132623","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 7th Gen (Kaby Lake) \/ Ryzen 3 1st Gen \/ or roughly equivalent 4 core processor<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 \/ AMD Radeon RX 470 \/  or equivalent performance<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 12<br><\/li><li><strong>네트워크:<\/strong> 초고속 인터넷 연결<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 2 GB 사용 가능 공간<br><\/li><li><strong>추가 사항:<\/strong> This should allow for 1080p 60FPS gameplay, with room for leeway for future game updates. You can probably get away with much lower minimum requirements than the ones listed here!<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Intel i5 9th Gen (Coffee Lake Refresh) \/ Ryzen 5 3rd Gen \/ or roughly equivalent 6 core processor<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 \/ AMD Radeon RX 6600 \/ or equivalent performance<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 12<br><\/li><li><strong>네트워크:<\/strong> 초고속 인터넷 연결<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 2 GB 사용 가능 공간<br><\/li><li><strong>추가 사항:<\/strong> This should allow for 1440p or higher resolutions at 100+ FPS. Furthermore, these are our recommended requirements for our future VR support.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Wired Creations Studio"],"publishers":["Wired Creations Studio"],"price_overview":{"currency":"KRW","initial":760000,"final":760000,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"₩ 7,600"},"packages":[1275833],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"DEATHMARK 구매","description":"","selection_text":"구매 옵션을 선택하세요","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1275833,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"DEATHMARK - ₩ 7,600","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":760000}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":1,"description":"멀티플레이어"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"온라인 PvP"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam 도전 과제"},{"id":15,"description":"통계"},{"id":62,"description":"가족 공유"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"액션"},{"id":"23","description":"인디"},{"id":"2","description":"전략"},{"id":"70","description":"앞서 해보기"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/fca135068835c3fceb8bae2b289984bd5cc6e273\/ss_fca135068835c3fceb8bae2b289984bd5cc6e273.600x338.jpg?t=1785132623","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/fca135068835c3fceb8bae2b289984bd5cc6e273\/ss_fca135068835c3fceb8bae2b289984bd5cc6e273.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785132623"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618560\/68c5456633880df7948a5